welry, beauty, F&B, home, wellness, plus B2B SaaS + real estate + healthcare + clinic verticals. Live client dashboards + case study PDFs shared under NDA on discovery call. Specific brand names anonymized publicly to protect client confidentiality."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do you set up attribution + tracking for brands in Mumbai?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Full server-side attribution stack: Meta Conversion API via GTM, Google Enhanced Conversions with hashed first-party data, offline conversion upload for closed orders/deals, LTV-based bidding, call tracking with dynamic phone-number swap, custom Google Data Studio dashboard with LTV/CAC/cohort breakdown. Attribution accuracy 85-95% at optimized setup (vs ~40% client-side only)."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How long before performance marketing becomes profitable for brands in Mumbai?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Typical maturity curve: Week 1-2 = learning phase (elevated CPI). Week 3-6 = first stable ROAS baselines. Month 2-3 = creative iteration + optimization (ROAS improves 30-60%). Month 4-6 = compounding retargeting + LAL audiences (ROAS improves 20-40% further). Month 6+ = predictable pipeline. Break-even usually month 2-3, ROI positive month 4+."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What creative velocity do you deliver per month for brands in Mumbai?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Starter: 6-10 variants/month (basic Reels + static). Growth: 12-20 variants + weekly refresh. Performance Pro: 20-40 variants + daily refresh on winners. Enterprise: 40-80 variants + weekly on-site shoots. Creative fatigue is the #1 killer of ROAS at scale — velocity + variety keeps CPIs low."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you handle Meta + Google + YouTube + Snapchat ads?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Full paid stack: Meta (Instagram + Facebook + Reels + CTWA), Google (Search + Shopping + Performance Max + Discovery + Gmail), YouTube (Skippable + Bumper + Shorts), Snapchat (GCC audiences especially), TikTok (where relevant + India), Amazon + Flipkart / Marketplace ads (D2C brands with marketplace presence). Choice depends on package tier + audience."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can we exit the contract after month 3 for brands in Mumbai?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes — ITD's standard MSA is 6-month with month-3 exit option if agreed milestones aren't met. IP + creative + data + ad accounts 100% client-owned. 30-day notice period. Full asset handover at exit. Zero cancellation penalty."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How does ITD compare on ad-spend markup vs other agencies?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "ITD charges <strong>zero markup</strong> on Meta + Google ad spend — you see exactly what platforms bill (transparent invoices monthly). Many agencies quietly keep 5-15% of ad spend as hidden margin. We disclose this upfront + it's non-negotiable ethics for ITD."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you offer inside-sales for high-AOV lead handling in brands in Mumbai?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes at Performance Pro + Enterprise tier. Inside-sales agent responds to qualified leads within 15 min business hours, runs 20-30 min discovery call, presents packages + financing, books consultations, handles 24hr + 7day follow-up. Lifts booking conversion 40-80% on high-AOV verticals (real estate, IVF, cosmetic, cardiac, luxury D2C)."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do I get started with performance marketing for brands in Mumbai?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Two ways: (1) Fill the package form on this page — we respond within 24 hours with scoped proposal + 90-day plan. (2) <a href=\"https://calendly.com/itdgrowthlabs-info/30min\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a free 30-min Calendly discovery call</a>. Prashant Chaudhari + senior partner runs the call. Free audit of your current ad stack