          <div class="pm-faq-item"><h3>6. How long before performance marketing becomes profitable for brands in Mumbai?</h3><div>Typical maturity curve: Week 1-2 = learning phase (elevated CPI). Week 3-6 = first stable ROAS baselines. Month 2-3 = creative iteration + optimization (ROAS improves 30-60%). Month 4-6 = compounding retargeting + LAL audiences (ROAS improves 20-40% further). Month 6+ = predictable pipeline. Break-even usually month 2-3, ROI positive month 4+.</div></div>
          <div class="pm-faq-item"><h3>7. What creative velocity do you deliver per month for brands in Mumbai?</h3><div>Starter: 6-10 variants/month (basic Reels + static). Growth: 12-20 variants + weekly refresh. Performance Pro: 20-40 variants + daily refresh on winners. Enterprise: 40-80 variants + weekly on-site shoots. Creative fatigue is the #1 killer of ROAS at scale — velocity + variety keeps CPIs low.</div></div>
